_Submitted by WatchPug_

[`CreditLimitByMedian.sol` L27-L78](https://github.com/code-423n4/2021-10-union/blob/4176c366986e6d1a6b3f6ec0079ba547b040ac0f/contracts/user/CreditLimitByMedian.sol#L27-L78)

```solidity
