*Submitted by [cccz](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-02-tapioca-findings/issues/21)*

In `AirdropBroker`, the owner calls `registerUsersForPhase` with `_phase = 4` to airdrop to users in epoch 4 to 8.

```solidity
