## [[M-05] [WP-M1] `BURNER_ROLE` can burn any amount of L2LivepeerToken from an arbitrary address](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-01-livepeer-findings/issues/194)
_Submitted by WatchPug, also found by cccz_.

