Any of the transfers in [exercise](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-06-putty/blob/3b6b844bc39e897bd0bbb69897f2deff12dc3893/contracts/src/PuttyV2.sol#L389-L458) make external calls to untrusted addresses.

