        if (!_isProposerPermitted(b, _resolver)) revert L1_UNAUTHORIZED();
```

<https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-03-taiko/blob/main/packages/protocol/contracts/L1/libs/LibProposing.sol#L93-L94>

